        "content": "### Run Explorer — exact completed run (Ops HTTP)\n\npipeline=`$pipeline` · run_type=`$run_type` · run_id=`$run_id` · workflow=`$workflow`\n\n`run_id` is **HTTP-only**. Expand **Run report detail** for recent list, funnel, reasons, reconciliation, artifacts. First paint: identity + processed records only."
